# Git must not change line endings anywhere in this archive.
#
# Every md5 recorded in a MANIFEST_*.tsv was measured on the file exactly as it is
# committed, with LF endings. On a machine where core.autocrlf is on, a checkout
# would rewrite those files with CRLF, and then every script md5 in every manifest
# would disagree with the file beside it - for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the analysis. Declaring the whole tree as not-text keeps the bytes as committed.
* -text
